    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for firewalld.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 8.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "firewalld is a firewall service daemon that provides a dynamic customizable firewall with a D-Bus interface.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* firewalld: firewalld: Local unprivileged user can modify firewall state due to D-Bus setter mis-authorization (CVE-2026-4948)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
      {
